  "honestNativeGap": "Fixture, recording, loopback and BLOCKED_ENV evidence are not Connected, native or first-party. Native Microsoft Entra resolution, HTTPS transport, durable provider receipts, independent readback, consented remediation, assignment/exemption mutation, certification, Outcome authority and Work Product adoption remain Layer-2 or host-authority exits."
}
